/**
 * OmniOS Milestone M3 Comprehensive Integration & Verification Suite
 * Covers ALL 12 M3 features (F-036 through F-047), ALL 15 M3 Edge Cases (#3, #5-#18),
 * dynamic runtime-nonce anti-hardcoding tests (Android multidex APK, Windows PE32+ & PE32),
 * concurrent cross-platform Android + Windows interop on a single live OmniKernel,
 * external host toolchain conformance (python3 zipfile/Adler-32/SHA-1, llvm-objdump, llvm-readobj),
 * Wave-1 adversarial security & hardening regressions (Android A1-A14, Windows W1-W13),
 * Wave-2 hardening regressions (Android S2-1-S2-4, Windows W2-1-W2-8),
 * Wave-3 hardening regressions (Android S3-1-S3-5, Windows W3-1-W3-4),
 * Wave-4 hardening regressions (Android S4-1-S4-5 / R1-R3, Windows W4-1-W4-4),
 * Wave-5 hardening regressions (Android S5-1-S5-5 / R4, Windows W5-1-W5-4),
 * Wave-6 hardening regressions (Android S6-1-S6-3 & R5, Windows W6-1-W6-3 / R2-1-R2-2),
 * and Wave-7 hardening regressions (Android S7-1-S7-3 & SharedPreferences symmetry,
 * Windows W7-1/R2-3, W7-2, W7-3 & symmetric Win32/Batch S7-1/S7-3b guards).
 *
 * Zero mocking of M1/M2/M3 subsystems; real WAL SQLite persistence; clean temp-dir teardown.
 */

